        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX SH105, Stainless Steel Frankfurt Lever with Rectangular SH Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Frankfurt Leverset has modern appeal. Choose from satin stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Stainless Steel Frankfurt Lever with Rectangular SH Rose is easy to install and features concealed mounting for a clean look. This door lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SH105-specifications.gif?v=1704354765\" width=\"514\" height=\"186\" border=\"0\" atl=\"INX-SH105 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel Frankfurt Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Hollow stainless steel lever.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction (TL4 Latch)</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX 105 Frankfurt Lever with SH Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-17/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub and Spindle: 5/16\" (8mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Standard Square Corner</li>\r\n<li>Latch Strike: Full Lip Strike and T-Strike with Square Corners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-Finish-3.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Inox Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
